@startuml epic-e-event-flow
!theme plain
title Epic E: 影像數據分析（歷史訓練）- Event Flow

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<command>> LightBlue
  BackgroundColor<<query>> LightCyan
  BackgroundColor<<event>> LightYellow
  BackgroundColor<<ui>> #E6E6FA
}

actor "教練/分析使用者" as User

' === UI 切換 ===
rectangle "切換分析頁籤" <<command>> as CMD_E001
rectangle "AnalysisTabSwitched\n分析頁籤已切換" <<ui>> as EVT_E001

' === Historical Training ===
rectangle "查詢歷史訓練" <<query>> as QRY_E001
rectangle "批次刪除訓練" <<command>> as CMD_E002

rectangle "HistoricalTrainingListQueried\n歷史訓練列表已查詢" <<event>> as EVT_E002
rectangle "TrainingsBatchDeleted\n訓練已批次刪除" <<event>> as EVT_E003

' === StrikeZone Record ===
rectangle "查看好球帶記錄" <<query>> as QRY_E002
rectangle "StrikeZoneRecordDisplayed\n好球帶記錄已顯示" <<event>> as EVT_E004

' 連線
User --> CMD_E001
CMD_E001 --> EVT_E001

User --> QRY_E001
QRY_E001 --> EVT_E002

User --> CMD_E002
CMD_E002 --> EVT_E003

User --> QRY_E002
QRY_E002 --> EVT_E004

note right of EVT_E001
  頁籤：
  - 訓練記錄
  - 選手紀錄
end note

note right of EVT_E003
  批次軟刪除
  保留歷史資料
end note

@enduml
